00:48:52.770 --> 00:48:55.200
you are part of what came before you,

1200
00:48:55.200 --> 00:48:56.820
you are present in the moment

1201
00:48:56.820 --> 00:48:58.320
and aligned with what's happening

1202
00:48:58.320 --> 00:49:00.870
and you are part of what's going to happen in the future.

1203
00:49:00.870 --> 00:49:02.460
Now the reason that is so,

1204
