00:49:05.010 --> 00:49:07.710
but we have this what I call lifespan bias.

1206
00:49:07.710 --> 00:49:09.929
So if you look at, go to the bookstore,

1207
00:49:09.929 --> 00:49:12.270
every kind of self-help book is about,

1208
00:49:12.270 --> 00:49:13.950
