3081
02:04:51.984 --> 02:04:53.643
And what it basically said was,

3082
02:04:55.260 --> 02:04:58.350
never forget what the Nazis did to your family.

3083
02:04:58.350 --> 02:05:01.762
And that's heavy, super heavy.

3084
02:05:01.762 --> 02:05:05.580
But it was him saying, be realistic,

3085
02:05:05.580 --> 02:05:07.920
do the work that you have to do,

3086
02:05:07.920 --> 02:05:10.080
but be realistic with what you have

3087
02:05:10.080 --> 02:05:11.330
and then move it forward.

3088
02:05:12.870 --> 02:05:15.780
My friends, do you know Scott Harrison from charity water?

3089
02:05:15.780 --> 02:05:16.613
Yeah.

3090
02:05:16.613 --> 02:05:20.160
