3113
02:06:27.930 --> 02:06:29.940
with other individuals, especially if there's dollars

3114
02:06:29.940 --> 02:06:31.920
put to it will do extremely well.

3115
02:06:31.920 --> 02:06:33.664
You won't be surprised that it was men who did this.

