3120
02:06:39.720 --> 02:06:44.460
So it's something that, but it's also innate in us

3121
02:06:44.460 --> 02:06:46.860
'cause it helped us from the Serengeti to today.

3122
02:06:48.990 --> 02:06:53.610
If we are to make it, which I profoundly think we are,

3123
02:06:53.610 --> 02:06:58.130
